  "version": "1.9.5",
  "changelog": "Two suite links arrive. (1) 'Open in Map Editor' now works end to end: in the Building Editor, pick a street and choose Open in Map Editor, and this app opens on that street's zone with the street centred and selected (the Building Editor side shipped in its 1.7.2). A handoff is used once and then removed; one older than 48 hours is ignored, and a broken one is set aside so it cannot loop. (2) Downloads now go through the one shared Adamsville suite cache (~/.local/share/adamsville-suite/cache/) \u2014 the same store the other editors use \u2014 so a file another editor already downloaded is reused instead of fetched again. Proof downloads after a save still always come fresh from GitHub.",
